    "type": "worldLore"
  },
  "demi-plane-changelog": {
    "text": "# Demi-Plane Update (Experimental)\n\nYour pocket dimension. Three options at creation: Innate, Awakened, or No Demi-Plane.\n\nAccess: Demi-Plane Gate ability or Demi-Plane Anchor item only. Nobody walks there. The Chamberlain manages the plane in your absence; fealty oaths expand it.\n\n## The Plane Today\nA fully built 5×5 grid of 25 regions around the Heartgate Basin core (Gateway Clearing, Hearth Springs, Mana Heart, Verdant Plot), with Tsukiko's private Veiled Fox Sanctuary and the Hidden Estate of the Mother Fox nested within it. World scale: 36 regions, 163 locations, 159 NPCs, 138 quests, 7 arcs.\n\n## Master-Map Workflow (current - Per-Region Tile Pass)\nThe realm uses ONE 12000 px master map (final_v3/master/master_map_12000px.jpg). Each of the 25 regions separately carries its own tile from final_v3/tiles/ with per-region crop focus and zoom hard-capped at 300, eliminating all inter-image seams. Region map border feathering and new-region generation are disabled in settings/locations.json. All earlier single-overlay crop-window approaches are superseded.",
